| RISC3D test: draws 300 frames two ways, checks the pixels and writes
| what happened to Results in this folder. Takes a few seconds.
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.01 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.RISC3D
RMEnsure Linux3D 0.01 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.Linux3D
Echo RISC3D test { > <Obey$Dir>.Results }
Run <Obey$Dir>.r3dtest 300 { >> <Obey$Dir>.Results }
Run <Obey$Dir>.r3dtest 300 vbo { >> <Obey$Dir>.Results }
RISC3D { >> <Obey$Dir>.Results }
Linux3D { >> <Obey$Dir>.Results }
SetType <Obey$Dir>.Results Text
Filer_Run <Obey$Dir>.Results
